Created [careers card expanded](https://www.figma.com/design/QEdBq6BLFUpduLpIRGZqbW/YFIOB-New-Designs?node-id=312-3513&t=P1DzzXagHVBHTExh-4) card. Component takes in the following parameters:

1. category - String (From the career assessment page)
2. careerName - String 
3. description - String 
4. salary - String
5. careerImages - An array of careerImages associated with the career



Sample Component Import (With Dummy Data);
<CareersCardExpanded 
	category={'Agriculture and Natural Resources'} 
        careerName={'Agricultural Architect'} 
	description={'Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed'}	
	salary={'Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed'}
	careerImages={['https://placehold.co/350x250', 'https://placehold.co/350x250', 'https://placehold.co/350x250']}
/>

